# distillation — Murky Draught item, 16×16 (design/DESIGN.md §3: murk-grey liquid,
# crooked cork). Shares the bottle-16 silhouette so the family reads together.
# Palette maps to design/DESIGN.md: Murk #5E5548 (working shade, ramped for form),
# Copper (cork), Glass. The Murk ramp and the derived shade tones have no concord
# glyph tokens — hex used with the DESIGN.md role named beside each entry.
size: 16

legend:
  . transparent
  K ink            # #0a0a0a outline
  c distillation.copper   # cork light face
  C #b85c3e        # Copper shadow — cork underside
  g distillation.glass    # pale glass highlight
  G #8fa6ae        # Glass shaded — lip away from light
  b ash            # #a89f93 — surface scum fleck / bubble
  m #7d7260        # Murk highlight — liquid surface toward the light
  u #5e5548        # Murk — DESIGN.md working shade, liquid midtone
  d #453e35        # Murk core shadow
  o #2e2922        # Murk occlusion — bottom, away from light

frame:
